                <pb facs="1409" n="1251" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1251"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-02-27"><hi rendition="#italic">February 27,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Meyer states that it has been officially announced that the Douma will
                    convene on the 10th of May.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
